// The renderer under celld (https://celld.dev), the stopgap for Cloudflare's
// Dynamic Workers until the account is on Workers Paid. `wrangler.jsonc` is
// the Cloudflare deployment of the same code.
//
// ⚠ A SEPARATE FILE BECAUSE celld REFUSES KEYS IT DOES NOT RUN - `observability`
// among them - and stops the deployment rather than ignoring them.
//
// ⚠ `no_bundle`, POINTING AT A FILE `bun run build:celld` MADE. See
// scripts/build-celld.ts for why the image carries no esbuild.
{
  "name": "i10-template-renderer",
  "main": "dist/worker.js",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-09-01",
  "no_bundle": true,
  "worker_loaders": [{ "binding": "LOADER" }],
}
